{"nodes": [{"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_owgt_profile", "label": "OWGT Linktree Profile (linktr.ee/owgt)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A separate OWGT-owned property, captured because the main site is otherwise a closed funnel: every outbound recruitment and social route OWGT has lives in this file, and its significantLink points back at the Wix Studio site."}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_profilepage_schema", "label": "JSON-LD ProfilePage + Person (sameAs, significantLink)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Declares dateCreated 2026-02-18, dateModified 2026-09-19, and a sameAs set (Instagram, YouTube, Discord, the Wix Studio site) that is the machine-readable identity graph for the whole org. The significantLink field makes the Wix site the profile's primary destination."}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_breadcrumblist_schema", "label": "JSON-LD BreadcrumbList (Linktree > OneWorldGreaterTogether)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_brand_bio", "label": "Bio 'Empowering students through education in Technology and STEM.'", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The social-surface variant of the main site's 'Empowering Through Technology': the site drops 'students/STEM' and the Linktree drops 'GreaterTogether', so the two properties each keep the half of the message their audience has not already inferred from context."}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_profile_title", "label": "Profile Title 'OneWorldGreaterTogether' (h1)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_profile_description", "label": "Profile Description Block (aria-label='Profile description')", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_avatar_image", "label": "Avatar / Logo (ugc.production.linktr.ee owgt-logo.png)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Preloaded at fetchPriority=high as avatar-v3_0 and reused for the Link Sans-adjacent profile chrome, so the logo is the LCP candidate on this property."}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_verified_badge", "label": "Verified Tick (avatarVerifiedTick / verificationTick)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Platform-granted identity signal on a third-party page. It substitutes for first-party trust cues (no About, no contact email on this property) that the main site already carries."}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_follow_button", "label": "Subscribe / Follow Button (disabled)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rendered with the disabled attribute because the organisation profile has no follower graph to join; the only true subscription path is the separate newsletter link."}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_share_profile_button", "label": "Share Profile Button (aria-label='Share profile')", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_social_icons", "label": "Social Icon Row (Website, Discord, YouTube, Instagram)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only four of the seven-plus destinations OWGT runs get an icon-row slot, and the omissions (TikTok, X) are exactly the two that do get their own full-width link cards. The icon row is for presence, the cards are for priority."}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_social_website", "label": "Social Icon - Website (owgtofficial.wixstudio.com/owgt)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_social_discord", "label": "Social Icon - Discord (discord.gg/PBMJax829D)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_social_youtube", "label": "Social Icon - YouTube (@OneWorldGreaterTogether)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_social_instagram", "label": "Social Icon - Instagram (@oneworldgreatertogether)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_link_website", "label": "Link Card 543097301 - Website", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_link_discord", "label": "Link Card 543097423 - Discord", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_link_whatsapp", "label": "Link Card 543107069 - WhatsApp (chat.whatsapp.com group invite)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Points at a WhatsApp group invite rather than a contact number, and this is the only OWGT destination in either file that has no counterpart on the Wix site - evidence of a region-specific community channel (OWGT runs India/US)."}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_link_newsletter", "label": "Link Card 597869028 - OWGT Newsletter (Sibforms embed)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Highest card id of the nine (597869028 vs the 543xxxx cluster), so it was added last - the newsletter is a later addition on top of the original link set. A double opt-in list is the one owned-audience channel OWGT has."}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_link_join_the_team", "label": "Link Card 543100423 - Join The Team (Google Form)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_link_tiktok", "label": "Link Card 543079124 - TikTok (@oneworldgreatertogether)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_link_x_twitter", "label": "Link Card 543099325 - X / Twitter (x.com/USOWGT)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only platform handle that deviates from the org name - @USOWGT rather than @oneworldgreatertogether - because the full name is taken on every other network."}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_link_instagram", "label": "Link Card 543098713 - Instagram (@oneworldgreatertogether)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_link_youtube", "label": "Link Card 543079121 - YouTube (@OneWorldGreaterTogether)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_glass_button_style", "label": "Link Card Glass Style (GLASS / stack / ROUNDED_LG / SHADOW_SM)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All nine cards are data-is-featured='false' and share one style token set, so no link is visually promoted - hierarchy comes from card order only, not from emphasis styling."}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_chatbase_ai_link", "label": "Chatbase AI Help Link 543100115 ('Questions? Ask our AI.')", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rendered last, after the OGGT-owned cards, as a Linktree overlay. It is third-party AI infrastructure injected into the org's own funnel - a third trust surface alongside the Wix site and the newsletter."}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_profile_theme", "label": "Profile Theme (#1061D3 background, data-luminance='DARK', CIRCLE_SMALL avatar)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Forced to Linktree's brand blue #1061D3 with all text #FFFFFF and DARK luminance - a default platform theme, not an OWGT palette. The linktree therefore presents a completely different colour identity from the main site, which shares no token with it."}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_caudex_typography", "label": "Caudex Profile Typography (--profileFontFamilyThemed)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Profile heading, link text, and banner all read --profileFontFamilyThemed: Caudex with per-role weights (header 700, description 500, link 500). Again platform-default, sharing nothing with the site's Familjen Grotesk / DIN Next pairing."}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_nextjs_profile_route", "label": "Next.js [profile] Route Chunk + build manifest", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The profile is statically generated from pages/%5Bprofile%5D plus _ssgManifest.js, pinned to build 866f1d24... and versioned in window.__RUNTIME_CONFIG__. The same build hash gates the chunk list, the CSS and the manifest, so the captured DOM is a single coherent snapshot."}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_geo_consent_banner", "label": "Geo Consent Banner (geo-consent.js + dg-consent-custom-style)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Datagrail consent loader with a custom Inter/1.5rem-radius shadow skin and a separate mobile-only grid layout under 480px. A GDPR gate OWGT does not own sits in front of its own recruitment links, and it adds a second consent surface absent from the Wix site."}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_runtime_config", "label": "window.__RUNTIME_CONFIG__ (analytics, ads, Stripe, Turnstile keys)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exposes a large platform config inline: Datadog RUM tokens, Google Ad Manager network code 23324369058, Stripe publishable key, Turnstile site key, ads country targets (ID,IN,MY,AR,CO,PH,TH,EG,MA,TR,PE,CL,BR). The country list is the clearest evidence of OWGT's actual geographic reach and it appears nowhere on the main site."}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_recommendations_carousel", "label": "Recommendations Carousel ('Visit X's Linktree profile page')", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "~55 unrelated profiles (musicians, coaches, resellers) are rendered below the fold by the platform. On a nonprofit's only social hub this dilutes the org's voice and drags Core Web Vitals, and it is not something OWGT configured."}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_og_image", "label": "Open Graph Image (linktr.ee/og/image/owgt.jpg, 600x600)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Referenced by og:image, og:image:secure_url, twitter:image, schema thumbnailUrl and image all at once. The Wix site ships no og:image at all, so link shares of OWGT get a Linktree-branded card while shares of the main site get none."}, {"id": "raw_source_code_linktree_snapchat_sticker", "label": "Snapchat Sticker (linktr.ee/sticker/owgt.png)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "raw_source_code_linktree_owgt_profile", "target": "raw_source_code_linktree_profile_title", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "raw_source_code_linktree_owgt_profile", "target": "raw_source_code_linktree_brand_bio", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "raw_source_code_linktree_owgt_profile", "target": "raw_source_code_linktree_profile_description", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "raw_source_code_linktree_profile_description", "target": "raw_source_code_linktree_brand_bio", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "raw_source_code_linktree_owgt_profile", "target": "raw_source_code_linktree_avatar_image", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "raw-source-code/linktree.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "raw_source_code_linktree_avatar_image", "target": "raw_source_code_linktree_profile_theme", "relation": "references", "confi